 Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-25T19:06:26-07:00","id":1222145,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1221781-soothsay-for-wealth-in-c20#post1221781\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In prior editions the most obvious blessing to be performed with soothsay was to help someone become affluent.<br /> <br /> But C20 made Soothsay a bit a less simply &quot;cause this or that to happen&quot;<br /> <br /> If a childling uses Augury to find the best path to wealth for her family, whats she likely to find, that gaining control of her parents is a good first step?<br /> <br /> If a kithain uses fatefire to bless a waitress he's pleased with, how could the blessing manifest?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Specific questions are easier. A childling who say wants their parents to be taken care of financially might be better off asking &quot;which lotto ticket should I buy&quot; or &quot;how can my dad get ahead at work&quot; or &quot;how can my Mom get her dream job..&quot;<br /> <br /> Fatefire on the waitress is easy. She gets one of those chance meetings that turns her life around. She bumps into a producer who thinks she's perfect for a minor part, or she impresses random undercover billionaire with her service and she gets a 10k tip. Or she's around to do something awesome and it goes viral on the internet. Or her Youtube channel she does on the side just happens to get promoted in the algorhythm and she's suddenly able to quit that job and do her blog fulltime.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-29T15:28:29-07:00","id":1223040,"title":"","content":"Fatefire in C20 only enhances her doesnt bend fate way it's written.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-30T09:28:44-07:00","id":1223293,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>c20</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fate Fire is more than simply a hanging bundle of<br /> extra successes or a nasty forced botch. It\u2019s Glamour<br /> woven into the tapestry of destiny itself by the deft<br /> hands of a master seer, and exists to enforce tales of<br /> staggering triumph in the darkest of hours, or terrible<br /> defeat at the cusp of victory. The triggers of the effects<br /> of this cantrip aren\u2019t intended to go off at random, but<br /> rather when it would be most dramatic</div> </div> </div> </div>All of my examples are covered by this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}